VoiceScribe bundles and builds on the following open-source work:

- whisper.cpp — Georgi Gerganov and contributors, MIT License
  https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp
  Compiled into the app as the on-device speech-recognition engine.

- OpenAI Whisper models (ggml conversions), MIT License
  https://github.com/openai/whisper
  Downloaded at runtime from the whisper.cpp model repository.

- tinydiarize — Akash Mahajan, MIT License
  https://github.com/akashmjn/tinydiarize
  Speaker-turn detection model, downloaded at runtime.

Full license texts are available at the URLs above.
